# Finish a WebUI change

`Deployment/webui` is the copy that ships. `Testing/webui-test` is the bind mount the test daemon serves. The test tree is gitignored.

After changing anything under `Deployment/webui`, before finishing:

1. Bump the interface semver, staying on `0.0.x` until told otherwise. A fix increments the patch (`0.0.1` to `0.0.2`). Set the same value in `boot.js` (`Twui.VERSION`), `sw.js` (`VERSION` and every shell URL), `index.html` (`application-version` and every `?v` query), `manifest.webmanifest` icon queries, and the `sw.js?v` registration in `app.js`.
2. Copy the deployment tree into the test area:

```bash
rsync -a --delete Deployment/webui/ Testing/webui-test/
```

Do both steps at the end of the change. Saving a file in `Deployment/webui` does not update the test tree or the cache-bust query.
